#Точки_Запуска_Extraction<[
Базис:
  Memory extraction is most valuable when Work Graph has a stable event boundary and enough evidence to separate durable knowledge from temporary run chatter.
Вектор:
  After worker run: extract patch summary, touched files, run outcome, provider capability facts and retry/blocker signals from Worker Output and worker-run evidence.
  After verification: extract decisions, invariants, howtos and evidence-summary records only when command/test/manual-review evidence succeeded or clearly failed with a reusable lesson.
  After human decision: create decision, user-preference or open-question records from explicit review/approval/rejection evidence.
  After blocker resolution: update risk/open-question/blocker-related records when the unblock action is known and evidence shows the blocker was resolved.
  Optional low-priority trigger: after a long planning/design session, create draft/needs-review records from protocol artifacts, not from raw transcript alone.
Цель:
  Extraction follows Work Graph lifecycle boundaries and produces auditable memory updates at points where knowledge has actually stabilized.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: memory-extraction-trigger-points-v1
  protocol.id: project-memory-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#MVP_Recommendation<[
Базис:
  Project Memory v1 already recommends human-readable .bvc memory atoms and derived JSON export, while Evidence v1 provides the source links needed by a memory writer.
Вектор:
  MVP next step: define a MemoryExtractionPack v1 staging schema based on KnowledgePack but with workItemId, evidenceIds, relatedFiles, relatedTasks and proposedOps.
  MVP next step: implement a log-only/inbox extractor mode that reads WorkItem, Worker Output/Evidence and protocol artifacts, then writes draft memory records for review.
  MVP next step: add dedup by stable keys first: type + sourceWorkItem + relatedFiles + normalized summary; semantic nearby search can come later as a derived retrieval feature.
  MVP next step: generate MEMORY.md as a derived compact projection grouped by Decisions, Invariants/Patterns, Gotchas/Risks, How-tos and Open Questions.
  MVP rule: no memory record reaches active status without evidence ids or explicit human decision; otherwise it remains draft/needs-review.
Цель:
  Ship a reviewable memory writer before adding vault routing, vector search or provider-specific transcript synthesis.

